title: "AI on Wikipedia"
abstract: "A descriptive, cross-language analysis of how the production (article creation, revision, coauthorship) and consumption (pageviews) of AI-related Wikipedia articles changed across the 20 most-read Wikipedia language editions before and after November 2022."
# `dataset` is the primary citable artifact of a data project; the code is described in codemeta.json.
